<title>USA: Featherlite files shelf for 300,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Featherlite files shelf for 300,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>CRESCO, Iowa 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Featherlite Manufacturing Inc said Monday it has filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission for the possible future sale of up to 300,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The shares were acquired by a shareholder in connection with Featherlite's acquisition of Vantare International Inc, Featherlite said, adding that the company will not receive any proceeds from sale of the shares.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
